Cleaning Supervisor
Location: Brisbane, Queensland
Employment Type: Full-Time

A growing commercial cleaning company is seeking an experienced Cleaning Supervisor to oversee cleaning operations across multiple commercial sites.

Key Responsibilities:

•	Coordinating and supervising daily cleaning activities across various locations;
•	Monitoring cleaning standards and ensuring work is completed to company requirements;
•	Preparing staff rosters and allocating duties to cleaning personnel;
•	Providing on-site training and guidance to team members;
•	Managing cleaning materials, supplies and equipment;
•	Ensuring workplace health and safety procedures are followed at all times;
•	Liaising with clients regarding operational matters and service delivery;
•	Conducting routine inspections and addressing performance issues where required.

Requirements:

•	Previous supervisory experience within the commercial cleaning industry;
•	Strong organizational and leadership skills;
•	Ability to manage staff and multiple work sites effectively;
•	Good communication and problem-solving abilities.
•	Language skills - English

Please submit your CV and cover letter to; - admin@bmpropertyservices.com.au
